newsletterMode: "teaser"
newsletterImage: "/posts/what-if-we-got-rid-of-cars/parking-to-park-areal.jpg"
featuredImage: "parking-to-park.jpg"
newsletterTeaser: "In the median European capital, cars get more ground than parks. I measured every road, parking lot and park in 39 capitals to find out how much green is on the table."
draft: true
fullBleed: true
tags:
