     --container, --orange, --muted, --body, --body-soft, --card, --ink)
     already exist site-wide in +layout.svelte with the same values the
     prototype used. Fonts come from @fontsource in the root layout — the
     prototype's base64-inlined @font-face blocks are gone. */
  .pp {
